```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Agent as LLM Agent
    participant API as Memory API
    participant Cache as Working Memory (Redis)
    participant Vector as Episodic Memory (PgVector)
    participant Graph as Relational Memory (Neo4j)
    
    Agent->>API: Retrieve Memory (query)
    API->>Cache: Fetch short-term context
    Cache-->>API: Context payload
    API->>Vector: Vector Similarity Search
    Vector-->>API: Top-K Similar Episodes
    API->>Graph: Entity Traversal Search
    Graph-->>API: Associated Nodes & Edges
    API->>API: Deduplicate & Rank
    API-->>Agent: Unified Memory Representation
```
